#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Open Frame is a lightweight, accessibility-minded multipurpose theme for business sites, blogs and portfolios. A token-driven design system keeps colors, typography and spacing consistent, and everything is controlled from the Customizer: global colors, fonts, layout widths, five header layouts with sticky and transparent modes, and a footer with up to four widget columns. It includes a keyboard-friendly navigation with an optional multi-column mega menu, sidebar and full-width layouts, a Landing Page template with ready-made block patterns, and full block editor support. It works with Elementor (including the Canvas and Full Width templates and the Pro Theme Builder) and styles WooCommerce stores. Fonts are bundled locally, no plugins are required and no remote requests are made."
msgstr ""

